{"speciesId":365,"names":{"fr":"Kaimorse","es":"Walrein","en":"Walrein","ja":"トドゼルガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"WALREIN’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons with one blow. This POKéMON’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"WALREIN swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il brise la glace avec ses grosses défenses. Sa graisse le protège du froid, mais aussi des attaques."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il brise la glace avec ses grosses défenses. Sa graisse le protège du froid, mais aussi des attaques."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice with its prized tusks."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice with its prized tusks."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il brise la glace avec ses grosses défenses. Sa graisse le protège du froid, mais aussi des attaques."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Rompe el hielo con sus colmillos. Su gruesa capa de grasa le protege del frío y de los enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな 氷を キバで 砕く。 厚い 脂肪は 寒さだけでなく 敵の 攻撃も はね返す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses robustes défenses pulvérisent la glace, et son épaisse couche de graisse repousse les attaques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus fuertes colmillos destrozan los témpanos de hielo. Su capa de grasa lo protege de sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"たくましい キバで 流氷を 粉砕する。分厚い 脂肪が 敵の 攻撃を 跳ね返す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les deux énormes défenses de Kaimorse peuvent détruire en un seul coup des blocs de glace de plus de 10 t. L’épaisse couche de graisse de ce Pokémon l’isole lorsque la température est en dessous de zéro."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Walrein tiene unos exagerados colmillos con los que puede hacer añicos bloques de hielo de hasta 10 toneladas de una sola dentellada. La gruesa capa de grasa que lo recubre le protege de temperaturas inferiores a 0 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Walrein’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing 10 tons with one blow. This Pokémon’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"発達した ２本の キバは １０トンも ある 氷山を 一撃で 粉砕する。 脂肪が ぶ厚く 氷点下でも 平気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kaimorse nage dans l’eau glacée et détruit les icebergs sur son passage à l’aide de ses grandes et impressionnantes défenses. Son épaisse couche de graisse lui permet de faire rebondir les attaques ennemies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Walrein va nadando por mares glaciales y destrozando icebergs con los enormes e imponentes colmillos que tiene. La gruesa capa de grasa que tiene en el cuerpo hace que los ataques enemigos reboten y no le hagan ningún daño."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Walrein swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大きな キバで 氷山を 砕きながら 氷点下の 海を 泳ぎ回る。 ぶ厚い 脂肪が 攻撃を 跳ね返す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ils vivent en groupes de 20 à 30 individus. Si un ennemi les attaque, le chef s’interpose pour tous les protéger, au péril de sa vie."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Forman manadas de unos 20 o 30 individuos. Si el grupo se ve atacado por un enemigo, el líder se interpondrá para proteger al resto."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Walrein form herds of 20 to 30 individuals. When a threat appears, the herd’s leader will protect the group with its life."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"２、３０匹で 群れを つくる。 敵に 襲われると リーダーは 体を 張って 群れを 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses défenses poussent tout au long de sa vie. Si l’une d’elles se brise au cours d’un combat, au bout d’un an, elle aura repoussé entièrement."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Sus colmillos nunca dejan de crecer. Aunque los pierda en un combate, al cabo de un año ya los habrá regenerado por completo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Walrein’s tusks keep growing throughout its life. Tusks broken in battle will grow back to their usual impressive size in a year."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"キバは 一生 伸び続ける。 戦いで 折れても １年あれば もとの 立派な キバに もどる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its thick tusks are strong enough to shatter drift ice. They have been known to break, but they will grow back by the next year. The Hisui region is well known for these broken tusks."}],"varieties":[{"id":365,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[5,"level-up",19],[6,"level-up",19],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",19],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",19],[9,"level-up",19],[10,"level-up",19],[11,"level-up",19],[12,"level-up",19],[13,"level-up",19],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"level-up",19],[15,"level-up",19],[16,"level-up",25],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0